# Author-local game references and build caches are never part of the public kit.
References/
Results/
MyMods/
Examples/*/Code/
ResearchArchive/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.zip
**/*.pdb
**/Source/UnityProject/Library/
**/Source/UnityProject/Temp/
**/Source/UnityProject/Logs/
**/Source/UnityProject/UserSettings/
**/Source/UnityProject/*.csproj
**/Source/UnityProject/*.sln

# Keep editable external project templates even if the Unity repository ignores generated projects.
!Examples/
!Examples/**/Source/
!Examples/**/Source/*.csproj
!Examples/**/Source/*.cs
